{"seq":5,"slug":"influence-and-legacy","title":"丹尼尔·卡尼曼·影响与遗产","stage":"DONE","category":"daniel-kahneman","categoryLabel":"丹尼尔·卡尼曼","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/influence-and-legacy","rating":{"composite":3.78,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/07_daniel-kahneman/5_influence-and-legacy","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"影响与遗产\">影响与遗产</h1><p>本卷追问一个具体问题：丹尼尔·卡尼曼（1934–2024）的研究，<strong>离开实验室之后到底改变了什么</strong>——经济学的边界、政府的政策工具、千万普通人的日常思维，以及科学界对「人类判断」的根本认识。本卷不复述他的理论本身，而是追踪这些理论的<strong>外溢与存续</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷-vs-兄弟卷-分工边界\">本卷 vs 兄弟卷：分工边界</h2><p>本人物 hub 共六卷。理解本卷的定位，关键是它处理的是「<strong>影响与后果</strong>」，而非「思想内容」或「客观评判」：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卷</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本卷的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">1 生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>他是谁、如何成长</td>\n<td>提供人物背景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">2 核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>前景理论、双系统等<strong>是什么</strong></td>\n<td>本卷讨论这些贡献的<strong>影响</strong>，机制细节去这里</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3 思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>他<strong>如何思考</strong>研究</td>\n<td>提供方法论根基</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">4 代表成就</a></td>\n<td>《思考快与慢》、诺奖<strong>本身</strong></td>\n<td>本卷讨论它们的<strong>传播效果</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>5 影响与遗产（本卷）</strong></td>\n<td>他<strong>改变了什么、为何不朽</strong></td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6 争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>他的工作<strong>站不站得住</strong></td>\n<td>本卷正面谈影响，争议与局限去这里</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话区分：<strong>核心贡献</strong>讲「损失厌恶是什么」，<strong>本卷</strong>讲「损失厌恶催生了行为金融学、改变了退休金政策」，<strong>争议与评价</strong>讲「损失厌恶在复制危机中受到的检验」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷结构与推荐学习路径\">本卷结构与推荐学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[第一章: 行为经济学的诞生] --&gt; B[第二章: 跨领域的影响]&#10;    B --&gt; C[第三章: 不朽的遗产]&#10;    A1[1 挑战理性人假设] --&gt; A2[2 助推与政策]&#10;    B1[1 对经济学与金融] --&gt; B2[2 对日常决策]&#10;    C1[1 心智的大师] --&gt; C2[2 不朽的智慧]&#10;    A --- A1&#10;    B --- B1&#10;    C --- C1\">flowchart TD\n    A[第一章: 行为经济学的诞生] --&gt; B[第二章: 跨领域的影响]\n    B --&gt; C[第三章: 不朽的遗产]\n    A1[1 挑战理性人假设] --&gt; A2[2 助推与政策]\n    B1[1 对经济学与金融] --&gt; B2[2 对日常决策]\n    C1[1 心智的大师] --&gt; C2[2 不朽的智慧]\n    A --- A1\n    B --- B1\n    C --- C1</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>第一章·行为经济学的诞生</strong>：从<a href=\"birth-of-behavioral-economics/challenging-rational-man\">挑战理性人假设</a>（学科起点）到<a href=\"birth-of-behavioral-economics/nudge-and-policy\">助推与政策</a>（政策落地）。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章·跨领域的影响</strong>：<a href=\"influence-across-fields/influence-on-economics-and-finance\">对经济学与金融</a>（学科层）与<a href=\"influence-across-fields/influence-on-everyday-decisions\">对日常决策</a>（个人层）两条线。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章·不朽的遗产</strong>：<a href=\"enduring-legacy/a-master-of-the-mind\">心智的大师</a>（历史地位）与<a href=\"enduring-legacy/lasting-wisdom\">不朽的智慧</a>（为何存续）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>前置建议</strong>：先读 <a href=\"../core-contributions/\">2 核心贡献</a>（尤其前景理论、双系统），再读本卷，影响的来龙去脉会清晰得多。<strong>读完本卷后</strong>，强烈建议接读 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6 争议与评价</a>——本卷正面呈现影响，那里提供必要的批判平衡（复制危机、理性之争），两卷合读才完整。</p>\n<p><strong>一条贯穿全卷的克制</strong>：卡尼曼本人反对将其遗产神化。本卷每一篇都在末尾保留「权衡与反模式」，刻意呈现影响的边界——这既是对史实的忠实，也是对他「带着证据的谦逊」的致敬。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"birth-of-behavioral-economics","title":"行为经济学的诞生","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/influence-and-legacy/birth-of-behavioral-economics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"challenging-rational-man","title":"挑战理性人假设","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/influence-and-legacy/birth-of-behavioral-economics/challenging-rational-man"},{"seq":2,"slug":"nudge-and-policy","title":"助推与政策","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/influence-and-legacy/birth-of-behavioral-economics/nudge-and-policy"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"influence-across-fields","title":"跨领域的影响","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/influence-and-legacy/influence-across-fields","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"influence-on-economics-and-finance","title":"对经济学与金融的影响","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/influence-and-legacy/influence-across-fields/influence-on-economics-and-finance"},{"seq":2,"slug":"influence-on-everyday-decisions","title":"对日常决策的影响","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/influence-and-legacy/influence-across-fields/influence-on-everyday-decisions"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"enduring-legacy","title":"不朽的遗产","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/influence-and-legacy/enduring-legacy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-master-of-the-mind","title":"心智的大师","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/influence-and-legacy/enduring-legacy/a-master-of-the-mind"},{"seq":2,"slug":"lasting-wisdom","title":"不朽的智慧","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/influence-and-legacy/enduring-legacy/lasting-wisdom"}]}]}